  "notes": "Legend descriptions copied as short printed notes, including the legend's 'NC: I2C serial data' text as printed. The 2x20 Raspberry Pi header in both images has no per-pin labels and is not transcribed. Image 2 shows the back side with the I2C address solder jumpers (JP1-JP4: GND 0x48 default, 3V3 0x49, SDA 0x4A, SCL 0x4B to ADDR); these are jumpers, not wiring points, so image 2 contributes no connectors."
